---
import DocsLayout from '../../../layouts/DocsLayout.astro';
import CodeExample from '../../../components/CodeExample.astro';
import PropsTable from '../../../components/PropsTable.astro';
---

<DocsLayout title="Accordion" activeNav="Accordion">

<h1>Accordion</h1>
<p class="ug-lead">Expandable content sections using native <code>&lt;details&gt;</code> and <code>&lt;summary&gt;</code> elements, with bordered and dark variants.</p>

<h2>Default Accordion</h2>

<CodeExample title="Default accordion">
<Fragment set:html={`<div class="ug-accordion">
  <details class="ug-accordion__item" open>
    <summary class="ug-accordion__header">
      What are the park hours?
      <span class="ug-accordion__caret"></span>
    </summary>
    <div class="ug-accordion__body">
      <p>The park is open 24 hours a day, 7 days a week, year-round. Some roads and facilities have seasonal closures.</p>
    </div>
  </details>
  <details class="ug-accordion__item">
    <summary class="ug-accordion__header">
      Do I need a reservation?
      <span class="ug-accordion__caret"></span>
    </summary>
    <div class="ug-accordion__body">
      <p>Reservations are required for camping. Day-use visitors do not need a reservation but may need a timed entry permit during peak season.</p>
    </div>
  </details>
  <details class="ug-accordion__item">
    <summary class="ug-accordion__header">
      Are pets allowed?
      <span class="ug-accordion__caret"></span>
    </summary>
    <div class="ug-accordion__body">
      <p>Pets are allowed in developed areas, on roads, and in campgrounds but must be on a leash no longer than six feet. Pets are not allowed on trails or in the backcountry.</p>
    </div>
  </details>
</div>`} />
</CodeExample>

<h2>Bordered Accordion</h2>

<CodeExample title="Bordered variant">
<Fragment set:html={`<div class="ug-accordion ug-accordion--bordered">
  <details class="ug-accordion__item" open>
    <summary class="ug-accordion__header">
      Hiking Information
      <span class="ug-accordion__caret"></span>
    </summary>
    <div class="ug-accordion__body">
      <p>Over 300 miles of maintained trails ranging from easy walks to strenuous backcountry routes.</p>
    </div>
  </details>
  <details class="ug-accordion__item">
    <summary class="ug-accordion__header">
      Camping Details
      <span class="ug-accordion__caret"></span>
    </summary>
    <div class="ug-accordion__body">
      <p>Twelve campgrounds offer a variety of settings from riverside to alpine meadows. Reservations recommended.</p>
    </div>
  </details>
  <details class="ug-accordion__item">
    <summary class="ug-accordion__header">
      Fishing Regulations
      <span class="ug-accordion__caret"></span>
    </summary>
    <div class="ug-accordion__body">
      <p>A park fishing permit is required. Catch and release only in designated streams. No live bait permitted.</p>
    </div>
  </details>
</div>`} />
</CodeExample>

<h2>Dark Accordion</h2>

<CodeExample title="Dark variant">
<Fragment set:html={`<div class="ug-accordion ug-accordion--dark">
  <details class="ug-accordion__item" open>
    <summary class="ug-accordion__header">
      Winter Conditions
      <span class="ug-accordion__caret"></span>
    </summary>
    <div class="ug-accordion__body">
      <p>Heavy snowfall closes most roads from November through April. Only the north entrance remains open year-round.</p>
    </div>
  </details>
  <details class="ug-accordion__item">
    <summary class="ug-accordion__header">
      Road Closures
      <span class="ug-accordion__caret"></span>
    </summary>
    <div class="ug-accordion__body">
      <p>Check the current road status before visiting. Construction and weather may cause temporary closures at any time of year.</p>
    </div>
  </details>
  <details class="ug-accordion__item">
    <summary class="ug-accordion__header">
      Emergency Services
      <span class="ug-accordion__caret"></span>
    </summary>
    <div class="ug-accordion__body">
      <p>Call 911 for emergencies. Ranger stations are located at major trailheads and visitor centers.</p>
    </div>
  </details>
</div>`} />
</CodeExample>

<h2>Class Reference</h2>

<PropsTable items={[
  { class: '.ug-accordion', description: 'Accordion container' },
  { class: '.ug-accordion__item', description: 'Individual accordion item (use <details>)' },
  { class: '.ug-accordion__header', description: 'Clickable header (use <summary>)' },
  { class: '.ug-accordion__caret', description: 'Rotating arrow indicator' },
  { class: '.ug-accordion__body', description: 'Expandable content area' },
  { class: '.ug-accordion--bordered', description: 'Bordered card-style variant' },
  { class: '.ug-accordion--flush', description: 'No outer borders (flush edges)' },
  { class: '.ug-accordion--dark', description: 'Dark background variant' },
]} />

</DocsLayout>
